  "decision_conditions": [
    "Condition : 1 - The permission hereby granted shall be for a limited period expiring on five years from the date of this decision when the use shall cease and the land restored to its former condition.",
    "Condition : 2 - The development hereby permitted shall be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and specifications: 100 Rev A, 101 Rev A, 102 Rev A, 110 Rev A, Cover Letter, Fire Statement received 12 April 2022",
    "Condition : 3 - The marquee shall not be used outside the hours of 9:00 ? 22:30 Sunday to Thursday and 9:00 ? 23:00 Friday to Saturday.",
    "Condition : 4 - No playing of musical instruments or operation of sound amplification equipment in association with the use of the marquee hereby permitted shall take place on Monday ? Thursdays (except Bank Holidays) and on other days outside the hours of 09:00 and 22:30",
    "Condition : 5 - The music or public address system noise levels in association with the development hereby permitted, when measured or predicted at 1m\r\nfrom the fa?ade of noise sensitive premises, shall not exceed 65dB(a) over a 15 minute period.",
    "Condition : 6 - Prior to first occupation of the hereby approved structure, a management plan for the operation of the marquee shall be submitted to and approved in writing by the Local Planning Authority. The operational management plan shall detail all events scheduled within the site and include details on how patrons will be managed whilst arriving and leaving the site. The development shall then be carried out in accordance with the approved details and retained thereafter.",
    "Condition : 7 - The use of the hereby approved marquee must remain ancillary to the existing Clubhouse at the Bowls Club."
  ],
